business owner

4
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:06,700
Most people picture entrepreneurship as a blank

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,380
page

6
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,090
a brilliant idea a garage years of

7
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:10,720
struggle

8
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,690
But there's another door that a lot

9
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:14,560
