They buy a business that already exists

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,260
A laundromat

12
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,740
A cleaning company

13
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,420
A local plumbing shop

14
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:24,430
Customers already come in employees already know

15
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,660
